        {
          "t": "p",
          "html": "I spearheaded the initial phase through foundational research and extensive stakeholder interviews within the city office to align technical requirements with operational needs. My contributions included rigorous industry benchmarking, analysis of utility modeling, and prototyping the interactive interface for frontline civil engineering workflows.",
